  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food Safety Macedonia - SPS Macedonia Audit and review</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Livsmedelss&#xe4;kerhet Makedonien</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SPS-Food Safety.Sept 2008 - Dec 2011. St&#xf6;d till Makedoniens  anpassning till EU inom omr&#xe5;det livsmedel vilket har betydelse f&#xf6;r produktion, handel och folkh&#xe4;lsa. Genomf&#xf6;rs av Macedonian Ministry of Health med st&#xf6;d av SWEDAC och Livsmedelsverket.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The SPS - Food Safety project in Macedonia (Sept 2008 - Dec 2011)aims at supporting Macedonia in adapting to the requirements of the EU and WTO in the area of food safety and international trade in food and foodstuffs. The project is implemented by the Macedonian Ministry of Health with the support of the Swedish agencies SWEDAC and National Food Administration, SLV.</narrative>
  </description>
